<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Penn Traffic raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Penn Traffic raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs analyst John Heinbockel has raised its rating for Penn Traffic Co to trading buy from market perform, a source at the brokerage said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company opened up 7/8 to 6-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
